</span></span><span><span>venv</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">\</span><span>Scripts</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">\</span><span>activate       </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 136, 152);"># Windows</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>pip </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(112, 184, 255);">install</span><span> -r requirements.txt
</span></span><span>python app.py</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>3. Abrí</strong> <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">http://127.0.0.1:5000</code> en el navegador.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Lo que incluye la página:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">🎨 Diseño oscuro premium con tema amarillo/neón — pensado para generar urgencia y clics</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">📢 Ticker animado con ofertas en el header (llama la atención inmediatamente)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">🗂️ Filtros por categoría (Celulares, TV, Computadoras, Audio, Gaming)</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">🃏 Cards con badge, descuento, estrellas, precio tachado y cuotas</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">🔗 Ruta <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">/go/{id}</code> que redirige a tu link de afiliado — fácil de trackear</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">📱 Responsive para mobile</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Barra de confianza (compra protegida, envío gratis, etc.)</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Para personalizar:</strong> abrí <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">app.py</code> y reemplazá los <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">affiliate_url</code> con tus links reales del panel de afiliados de Mercado Libre. El README tiene todas las instrucciones detalladas.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"><div class="flex text-left font-ui rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-0.5 transition duration-300 w-full hover:bg-bg-000/50 px-4 border-border-300/15 hover:border-border-200" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Techdeal ar. Abrir artefacto."><div class="artifact-block-cell group/artifact-block flex flex-1 align-start justify-between w-full"><div class="flex flex-1 gap-2 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-end w-[68px] relative shrink-0"><div class="absolute right-2 flex flex-1 overflow-hidden w-[52px] h-[71px] rounded-t-lg border-0.5 border-border-200 select-none scale-[1] group-hover/artifact-block:scale-[1.035] -rotate-[0.1rad] group-hover/artifact-block:-rotate-[0.065rad] duration-300 ease-out group-hover/artifact-block:duration-400 group-hover/artifact-block:ease-[cubic-bezier(0,0.9,0.5,1.35)] transition-transform backface-hidden will-change-transform translate-y-[19%] bg-gradient-to-b from-bg-000 to-bg-000/0 pt-4 items-start justify-center h-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="text-text-500"><path d="M212.24,83.76l-56-56A6,6,0,0,0,152,26H56A14,14,0,0,0,42,40V216a14,14,0,0,0,14,14H200a14,14,0,0,0,14-14V88A6,6,0,0,0,212.24,83.76ZM158,46.48,193.52,82H158ZM200,218H56a2,2,0,0,1-2-2V40a2,2,0,0,1,2-2h90V88a6,6,0,0,0,6,6h50V216A2,2,0,0,1,200,218Z"></path></svg></div></div><div c