ansparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">¡Fácil! Tenés varias opciones:</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Opción 1 — Desde el Explorador de Windows (la más simple)</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Buscá el archivo <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">techdeal-ar.zip</code> en tu carpeta de Descargas</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Hacé <strong>clic derecho</strong> sobre él</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Elegí <strong>"Extraer todo..."</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Seleccioná dónde querés guardarlo y hacé clic en <strong>Extraer</strong></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Abrí VS Code → <strong>Archivo → Abrir carpeta</strong> → seleccioná la carpeta <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">techdeal-ar</code></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Opción 2 — Desde la terminal de VS Code</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Si ya tenés VS Code abierto, abrí la terminal (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Ctrl+Ñ</code>) y escribí:</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="Código en bash" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
