ansparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Ese error significa que <strong>Python no está instalado</strong> en tu PC (o no está configurado en el PATH de Windows). Seguí estos pasos:</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>1. Instalá Python</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Entrá a <strong>python.org/downloads</strong> y descargá la última versión</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Al instalar, <strong>marcá obligatoriamente</strong> esta casilla antes de hacer clic en "Install Now":
☑️ <strong>"Add Python to PATH"</strong> ← sin esto el error persiste</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>2. Verificá que se instaló bien</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Cerrá VS Code, volvé a abrirlo (importante — para que tome el PATH nuevo) y en la terminal escribí:</p>
