<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Para usarlo en tu página web:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Hacé clic derecho sobre el logo → <strong>"Guardar imagen como..."</strong> o hacé una captura de pantalla recortada</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Guardalo como <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">logo.png</code> dentro de <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">techdeal-ar/static/</code></li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Agregalo en <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">index.html</code> reemplazando el logo de texto:</li>
</ol>
